 analyzing the ethical risks and issues raised by AI, ethical guidelines and principles issued by different organizations, approaches for addressing ethical issues in AI, methods for evaluating the ethics of AI. Additionally, challenges in implementing ethics in AI and some future perspectives are pointed out. We hope our work will provide a systematic and comprehensive overview of AI ethics for researchers and practitioners in this field, especially the beginners of this research discipline."}]", "excerpt_truncated": true, "source_sha256": "1670a403db5124406c60f8f2f49e838ebbde56f6dde3af81558449e503f99df8", "verification_required": true, "topic_domain": "responsibility_formation", "evidence_role": "discovery", "host_tier": "discovery", "source_identity": null, "persistent_identifiers": ["doi:10.60087/jaigs.v8i1.363", "doi:10.1109/tai.2022.3194503", "openalex:W4410431452"], "source_candidates": ["https://doi.org/10.60087/jaigs.v8i1.363", "https://doi.org/10.1109/tai.2022.3194503", "https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/ielx7/9078688/9184921/09844014.pdf"], "source_candidate_identities": {}}

